estones/8/labels","id":1730720,"node_id":"MDk6TWlsZXN0b25lMTczMDcyMA==","number":8,"title":"4.0.2","description":"","creator":{"login":"ulissesalmeida","id":867308,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzMwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/867308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida","html_url":"https://github.com/ulissesalmeida","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"open_issues":0,"closed_issues":5,"state":"closed","created_at":"2016-04-25T22:12:11Z","updated_at":"2016-05-03T03:02:31Z","due_on":null,"closed_at":"2016-05-03T03:02:31Z"},"comments":2,"created_at":"2016-04-29T21:19:23Z","updated_at":"2016-05-03T02:58:30Z","closed_at":"2016-05-03T02:58:30Z","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested on:\n- Ruby 2.2.2\n- Rails 4.2.4\n- Devise 3.5.8\n- Warden 1.2.6\n### Problem:\n\n[`Devise::Models::Lockable::ClassMethods#unlock_strategy_enabled?`](http://www.rubydoc.info/github/plataformatec/devise/master/Devise/Models/Lockable/ClassMethods#unlock_strategy_enabled%3F-instance_method) always returns `true` for `:both` strategy\n\nNote `:time`, `:email`, and `:none` do not exhibit this bug.\n\nThis can be problem for those who choose to extend the functionality of Lockable or rely on the method to determine code paths based on the `:none` strategy.\n## Steps to Reproduce\n1. Create a minimal Rails 4 app\n2. Add Devise gem, run the devise install generator, generate a devise user\n3. Add the `:lockable` module for user, uncomment the lockable migration lines and run migrations\n4. Go into devise initializer and ensure `config.unlock_strategy = :both` is set\n5. Boot up Rails console\n## Expected\n\n```\n2.2.2 :001 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :none\n => false\n2.2.2 :001 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :sadsa\n => false\n2.2.2 :002 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :both\n => true\n2.2.2 :003 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :time\n => true\n2.2.2 :004 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :email\n => true\n```\n## Actual\n\n```\n2.2.2 :001 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :none\n => true\n2.2.2 :001 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :sadsa\n => true\n2.2.2 :002 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :both\n => true\n2.2.2 :003 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :time\n => true\n2.2.2 :004 > User.unlock_strategy_enabled? :email\n => true\n```\n\nAs you can see `:sadsa` and `:none` were considered `true`.\n","closed_by":{"login":"ulissesalmeida","id":867308,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg2NzMwOA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/867308?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida","html_url":"https://github.com/ulissesalmeida","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/ulissesalmeida/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heartcombo/devise/issues/4072/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/heartcombo/devise/issues/4072/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":"completed"}